TikZ是LaTeX中强大的矢量图形绘制包，使用PGF作为底层系统。基本语法结构：

```latex
\begin{tikzpicture}[选项]
  \draw[选项] (x1,y1) -- (x2,y2);
  \node[选项] at (x,y) {文本};
  \fill[选项] (x,y) circle (半径);
\end{tikzpicture}
```

常用坐标表示：
- 直角坐标：`(2,3)`
- 极坐标：`(30:2)` 表示角度30度，长度2
- 相对坐标：`+(dx,dy)` 或 `++(dx,dy)`

基本绘图命令：`\draw`, `\fill`, `\filldraw`, `\path`

TikZ支持多种基本图形绘制：

```latex
\begin{tikzpicture}
  % 直线
  \draw (0,0) -- (2,1);

  % 折线
  \draw (0,1) -- (1,2) -- (2,0);

  % 矩形
  \draw (0,0) rectangle (2,1);

  % 圆
  \draw (3,0.5) circle (0.5cm);

  % 椭圆
  \draw (5,0.5) ellipse (1cm and 0.5cm);

  % 圆弧
  \draw (7,0.5) arc (0:90:1cm);

  % 网格
  \draw[step=0.5,gray,very thin] (0,0) grid (3,3);
\end{tikzpicture}
```

图形参数：`line width`, `color`, `dashed`, `dotted`等

TikZ提供丰富的路径操作：

```latex
\begin{tikzpicture}
  % 基本路径操作
  \draw (0,0) -- (1,1) -| (2,0) |- (3,1);

  % 曲线
  \draw (0,2) .. controls (1,3) and (2,3) .. (3,2);

  % 贝塞尔曲线
  \draw (0,1) to[out=30,in=150] (3,1);

  % 闭合路径
  \draw (4,0) -- (5,1) -- (6,0) -- cycle;

  % 路径样式
  \draw[red, thick, dashed] (7,0) -- (8,1) -- (9,0);

  % 箭头
  \draw[->, >=stealth] (0,3) -- (2,3);
  \draw[<->, thick] (3,3) -- (5,3);
\end{tikzpicture}
```

箭头样式：`->`, `<-`, `<->`, `> = stealth`, `> = latex`等

节点是TikZ中用于放置文本和图形的容器：

```latex
\begin{tikzpicture}[node distance=2cm]
  % 基本节点
  \node[draw] (A) at (0,0) {节点A};
  \node[circle,fill=blue!20] (B) at (2,1) {B};

  % 相对定位
  \node[draw, below of=A] (C) {下方节点};
  \node[draw, right of=B] (D) {右侧节点};

  % 节点连接
  \draw[->] (A) -- (B);
  \draw[<->] (A) to[bend left] (C);

  % 节点样式
  \node[rectangle, draw=red, fill=yellow, thick, 
         minimum width=2cm, minimum height=1cm] 
        at (4,0) {样式节点};
\end{tikzpicture}
```

节点形状：`rectangle`, `circle`, `ellipse`, `diamond`等

TikZ支持丰富的颜色和填充选项：

```latex
\begin{tikzpicture}
  % 预定义颜色
  \draw[red, thick] (0,0) -- (2,0);
  \fill[blue] (3,0) circle (0.5);

  % 颜色混合
  \fill[green!40!white] (5,0) rectangle (7,1);
  \fill[blue!50!red] (8,0) ellipse (0.5 and 0.3);

  % 渐变填充
  \shade[top color=blue, bottom color=red] 
        (0,2) rectangle (2,3);
  \shade[ball color=green] (4,2.5) circle (0.5);

  % 图案填充
  \fill[pattern=north east lines] 
        (6,2) rectangle (8,3);
  \fill[pattern=dots] (10,2) circle (0.5);

  % 透明度
  \fill[red, opacity=0.5] (0,4) rectangle (1,5);
  \fill[blue, opacity=0.3] (0.5,4.5) circle (0.5);
\end{tikzpicture}
```

颜色模式：RGB, CMYK, HTML, 灰度等

TikZ提供多种坐标系和变换操作：

```latex
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.5]
  % 自定义坐标系
  \draw[->] (0,0) -- (2,0) node[right] {x};
  \draw[->] (0,0) -- (0,2) node[above] {y};

  % 极坐标点
  \fill (30:1.5) circle (2pt) node[above] {(30:1.5)};
  \fill (120:1) circle (2pt) node[left] {(120:1)};

  % 坐标计算
  \draw (1,1) -- ($(1,1) + (0.5,0.5)$);
  \draw (2,1) -- ($(2,1)!0.5!(3,2)$);

  % 变换
  \begin{scope}[xshift=4cm, rotate=30]
    \draw[red] (0,0) rectangle (1,1);
    \node at (0.5,0.5) {旋转30°};
  \end{scope}

  % 缩放变换
  \begin{scope}[yshift=-2cm, xscale=2, yscale=0.5]
    \draw[blue] (0,0) rectangle (1,1);
    \node at (0.5,0.5) {缩放变换};
  \end{scope}
\end{tikzpicture}
```

需要`\usetikzlibrary{calc}`库进行坐标计算

可以定义样式来提高代码重用性：

```latex
\begin{tikzpicture}[
    mynode/.style={circle, draw=blue, fill=blue!20, minimum size=1cm},
    myarrow/.style={->, >=stealth, thick, red},
    dashedline/.style={dashed, gray, line width=2pt}
  ]

  % 使用自定义样式
  \node[mynode] (A) at (0,0) {A};
  \node[mynode] (B) at (2,1) {B};
  \node[mynode, fill=red!20] (C) at (1,-1) {C};

  \draw[myarrow] (A) -- (B);
  \draw[dashedline] (A) -- (C);

  % 带参数的样式
  \tikzset{
    colorbox/.style 2 args={
      rectangle, draw=#1, fill=#1!20, minimum width=#2
    }
  }

  \node[colorbox={green}{2cm}] at (3,0) {绿色盒子};
  \node[colorbox={orange}{1.5cm}] at (3,-1) {橙色盒子};
\end{tikzpicture}
```

样式继承：`mystyle/.style={base style, additional options}`

TikZ通过库扩展功能：

```latex
\usetikzlibrary{arrows.meta, shapes.geometric, positioning}

\begin{tikzpicture}[
    node distance=1cm,
    every node/.style={draw, fill=blue!10}
  ]

  % 使用positioning库
  \node (A) {A};
  \node[below=of A] (B) {B};
  \node[right=of A] (C) {C};
  \node[below right=of A] (D) {D};

  % 几何形状
  \node[star, fill=yellow] at (3,0) {星形};
  \node[diamond, fill=green] at (4,0) {菱形};
  \node[regular polygon, regular polygon sides=6] at (5,0) {六边形};

  % 高级箭头
  \draw[-{Stealth[scale=1.5]}, thick] (A) -- (C);
  \draw[{Circle[open]}->] (B) -- (D);
\end{tikzpicture}
```

常用库：`arrows`, `shapes`, `positioning`, `calc`, `decorations`等

使用decorations库添加装饰效果：

```latex
\usetikzlibrary{decorations.pathmorphing, decorations.markings}

\begin{tikzpicture}
  % 路径变形装饰
  \draw[decorate, decoration={snake, amplitude=2pt, segment length=10pt}] 
        (0,0) -- (3,0);

  \draw[decorate, decoration={zigzag, amplitude=2pt, segment length=6pt}] 
        (0,1) -- (3,1);

  % 标记装饰
  \draw[decorate, decoration={markings, mark=at position 0.5 with {\arrow{>}}}] 
        (0,2) -- (3,2);

  \draw[decorate, decoration={
    markings,
    mark=at position 0.2 with {\node[red] {X};},
    mark=at position 0.8 with {\draw[blue] (0,0) circle (2pt);}
  }] (0,3) -- (3,3);

  % 文本装饰
  \draw[decorate, decoration={
    text along path,
    text={This is text along a path},
    text color=red
  }] (0,4) to[bend left] (3,4);
\end{tikzpicture}
```

装饰类型：`snake`, `zigzag`, `markings`, `text along path`等

使用scope和相对定位创建复杂图形：

```latex
\usetikzlibrary{positioning}

\begin{tikzpicture}[
    box/.style={draw, minimum width=1.5cm, minimum height=0.8cm},
    arrow/.style={->, >=stealth}
  ]

  % 流程图形状
  \node[box] (start) {开始};
  \node[box, below=of start] (process) {处理过程};
  \node[diamond, draw, below=of process, aspect=2] (decision) {判断};
  \node[box, below left=of decision] (yes) {是};
  \node[box, below right=of decision] (no) {否};
  \node[box, below=3cm of process] (end) {结束};

  % 连接线
  \draw[arrow] (start) -- (process);
  \draw[arrow] (process) -- (decision);
  \draw[arrow] (decision) -| node[above] {条件满足} (yes);
  \draw[arrow] (decision) -| node[above] {条件不满足} (no);
  \draw[arrow] (yes) |- (end);
  \draw[arrow] (no) |- (end);
  \draw[arrow] (end) -| (process);

  % 使用scope分组
  \begin{scope}[xshift=5cm, yshift=0cm]
    \draw[fill=blue!20] (0,0) rectangle (2,1);
    \draw[fill=red!20] (1,0.5) circle (0.3);
    \node at (1,1.5) {分组图形};
  \end{scope}
\end{tikzpicture}
```

相对定位语法：`below=of A`, `above left=of A`, `right=2cm of A`等

绘制数学函数和几何图形：

```latex
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.2]
  % 坐标轴
  \draw[->] (-0.5,0) -- (3.5,0) node[right] {$x$};
  \draw[->] (0,-1.5) -- (0,1.5) node[above] {$y$};
  \draw (0,0) node[below left] {$O$};

  % 网格
  \draw[gray, very thin] (-0.5,-1.5) grid (3.5,1.5);

  % 函数绘制
  \draw[domain=0:3.2, smooth, samples=100, thick, blue] 
        plot (\x, {sin(\x r)});
  \draw[domain=0:3.2, smooth, samples=100, thick, red] 
        plot (\x, {cos(\x r)});

  % 数学标注
  \node[blue] at (1.5,1) {$y = \sin x$};
  \node[red] at (2.5,-1) {$y = \cos x$};

  % 几何图形
  \draw (4,0) circle (1);
  \draw (4,0) -- (5,0) node[midway, below] {$r$};
  \draw (4,0) -- (4.7,0.7);
  \fill (4,0) circle (1pt);
  \node at (4, -1.5) {圆 $x^2 + y^2 = r^2$};
\end{tikzpicture}
```

数学函数语法：`{sin(\x r)}`, `{exp(\x)}`, `{0.5*\x^2}`等

使用beamer和TikZ创建动画效果：

```latex
\documentclass{beamer}
\usepackage{tikz}
\usetikzlibrary{overlay-beamer-styles}

\begin{document}
\begin{frame}{TikZ动画示例}
\begin{tikzpicture}
  % 逐步显示的节点
  \node<1->[circle, draw] (A) at (0,0) {步骤1};
  \node<2->[circle, draw, right=of A] (B) {步骤2};
  \node<3->[circle, draw, right=of B] (C) {步骤3};

  % 逐步绘制的连线
  \draw<2->[->] (A) -- (B);
  \draw<3->[->] (B) -- (C);

  % 高亮效果
  \node<4>[circle, draw, fill=yellow] at (B) {高亮};
\end{tikzpicture}
\end{frame}
\end{document}
```

动画控制：`<1>`, `<2->`, `<3-4>`, `\pause`等

使用TikZ绘制专业电路图：

```latex
\usetikzlibrary{circuits.ee.IEC}

\begin{tikzpicture}[circuit ee IEC]
  % 电源
  \draw (0,0) to [battery] (0,2);

  % 电阻
  \draw (0,2) to [resistor] (2,2);

  % 电容
  \draw (2,2) to [capacitor] (2,0);

  % 电感
  \draw (2,2) to [inductor] (4,2);

  % 二极管
  \draw (4,2) to [diode] (4,0);

  % 闭合回路
  \draw (4,0) to (0,0);

  % 电流方向标注
  \draw[->, red, thick] (0.5,1.5) -- (1.5,1.5);
  \node[red] at (1,1) {I};
\end{tikzpicture}
```

电路元件库：`circuits.ee.IEC`, `circuits.logic`等

绘制树形数据结构：

```latex
\usetikzlibrary{trees}

\begin{tikzpicture}[level distance=1.5cm,
  level 1/.style={sibling distance=3cm},
  level 2/.style={sibling distance=1.5cm}]

  \node {根节点}
    child {node {子节点1}
      child {node {叶子1}}
      child {node {叶子2}}
    }
    child {node {子节点2}
      child {node {叶子3}}
      child {node {叶子4}}
    };
\end{tikzpicture}

% 二叉树示例
\begin{tikzpicture}[
    level distance=1cm,
    level 1/.style={sibling distance=4cm},
    level 2/.style={sibling distance=2cm},
    level 3/.style={sibling distance=1cm}
  ]

  \node[circle,draw] {A}
    child {node[circle,draw] {B}
      child {node[circle,draw] {D}}
      child {node[circle,draw] {E}}
    }
    child {node[circle,draw] {C}
      child {node[circle,draw] {F}}
      child {node[circle,draw] {G}}
    };
\end{tikzpicture}
```

树形结构控制：`level distance`, `sibling distance`, `growth parent anchor`

使用TikZ创建简单的图表：

```latex
\begin{tikzpicture}[ybar, bar width=0.6cm]
  % 坐标轴
  \draw[->] (0,0) -- (6,0) node[right] {月份};
  \draw[->] (0,0) -- (0,5) node[above] {销量};

  % 刻度
  \foreach \x/\m in {1/1月,2/2月,3/3月,4/4月,5/5月}
    \draw (\x,0) node[below] {\m} -- (\x,-0.1);

  \foreach \y in {1,2,3,4}
    \draw (0,\y) node[left] {\y万} -- (-0.1,\y);

  % 柱状图
  \fill[blue!30] (0.7,0) rectangle (1.3,3.2);
  \fill[red!30] (1.7,0) rectangle (2.3,2.5);
  \fill[green!30] (2.7,0) rectangle (3.3,4.1);
  \fill[orange!30] (3.7,0) rectangle (4.3,3.8);
  \fill[purple!30] (4.7,0) rectangle (5.3,2.9);

  % 图例
  \draw[fill=blue!30] (0.5,-1) rectangle (0.8,-0.7);
  \node[right] at (0.8,-0.85) {产品A};
\end{tikzpicture}
```

图表类型：柱状图、折线图、饼图等

TikZ绘图中的常见错误和调试方法：

```latex
% 1. 坐标范围错误
\draw (0,0) -- (10,10); % 可能超出页面范围

% 2. 库未导入错误
% \usetikzlibrary{calc} % 忘记导入库

% 3. 语法错误示例
% \draw (0,0 -- (1,1); % 缺少右括号
% \node at (0,0 {文本}; % 缺少右括号

% 调试技巧：逐步构建
\begin{tikzpicture}
  % 第一步：绘制参考网格
  \draw[help lines] (0,0) grid (3,3);

  % 第二步：标记关键点
  \foreach \x in {0,1,2,3}
    \foreach \y in {0,1,2,3}
      \fill (\x,\y) circle (1pt);

  % 第三步：逐步添加图形元素
  \draw[red] (0,0) -- (1,1);
  \draw[blue] (1,1) -- (2,2);
\end{tikzpicture}

% 使用scope隔离问题
\begin{tikzpicture}
  \begin{scope}[red] % 隔离样式影响
    \draw (0,0) -- (1,1);
  \end{scope}
\end{tikzpicture}
```

调试工具：`help lines`, 临时颜色标记，分步构建

提高TikZ绘图性能的技巧：

```latex
% 1. 减少采样点（对于平滑曲线）
\draw[domain=0:2*pi, samples=50] plot ({\x}, {sin(\x r)}); % 良好
% \draw[domain=0:2*pi, samples=500] plot ({\x}, {sin(\x r)}); % 过度

% 2. 重用样式定义
\tikzset{
  myline/.style={thick, blue},
  mynode/.style={circle, draw, fill=white}
}

% 3. 使用相对坐标和命名坐标
\begin{tikzpicture}
  \coordinate (A) at (0,0);
  \coordinate (B) at (3,1);
  \draw (A) -- (B);
  \draw (A) -- ($(A)!0.5!(B)$); % 中点
\end{tikzpicture}

% 4. 避免复杂的实时计算
% 不好的做法：\draw (0,0) -- ({sin(\x)}, {cos(\x)});
% 好的做法：预先计算或使用plot

% 5. 使用externalize库处理大型图形
% \usetikzlibrary{external}
% \tikzexternalize % 将TikZ图形外部化
```

性能优化：减少采样点，重用样式，预计算坐标
